      "content": "it’s not just a pause though. it feels more like a decline. i can't even get up from this chair without a struggle anymore. it's humiliating really. i used to be so independent, and now i'm just... waiting. waiting for something to break or for the end to just happen. it feels like i've lost all my agency.",
